{"id":"6c54ff0b5f31df9f","group":"89","path":"89/89-df-lob-derivation-rule.md","title":"Löb Derivation Rule","display":"df-lob-derivation-rule — Löb Derivation Rule","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"The Logic of Provability","book_abbrev":"89","label":"89-df-lob-derivation-rule","aliases":["89-df-lob-derivation-rule"],"display":"df-lob-derivation-rule — Löb Derivation Rule","depends_on":["[[89-df-gl-rule-lob]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"The Logic of Provability"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"89"},{"key":"label","html":"89-df-lob-derivation-rule"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>89-df-lob-derivation-rule</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-lob-derivation-rule — Löb Derivation Rule"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"f661762c12e8f92b\" href=\"?note=f661762c12e8f92b\" title=\"89-df-gl-rule-lob\">89-df-gl-rule-lob</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal{R}_{L}\\subseteq\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}^{&lt;\\omega}\\times\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}\">\\(\\mathcal{R}_{L}\\subseteq\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}^{&lt;\\omega}\\times\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}\\)</span> is the admissible Löb-rule relation (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"f661762c12e8f92b\" href=\"?note=f661762c12e8f92b\" title=\"89-df-gl-rule-lob\">89-df-gl-rule-lob</a>).</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal R^{\\mathrm{der}}_L\">\\(\\mathcal R^{\\mathrm{der}}_L\\)</span> 是下述定义的可容许 Löb 规则关系别名，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{der}\">\\(\\mathrm{der}\\)</span> 为推导接口的角色上标。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}lob\\text{-}derivation\\text{-}rule}\\vdash\n\\mathcal{R}^{\\mathrm{der}}_{L}\n\\coloneqq\n\\mathcal{R}_{L}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}lob\\text{-}derivation\\text{-}rule}\\vdash\n\\mathcal{R}^{\\mathrm{der}}_{L}\n\\coloneqq\n\\mathcal{R}_{L}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>关键符号：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{GL}\">\\(\\mathrm{GL}\\)</span> : GL逻辑 (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"0006800fa1c85177\" href=\"?note=0006800fa1c85177\" title=\"89-df-gl-logic\">89-df-gl-logic</a>)</li>\n<li>Löb推导规则 (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"b22854791214adbd\" href=\"?note=b22854791214adbd\" title=\"89-df-lob-derivation\">89-df-lob-derivation</a>)</li>\n<li>如果&quot;可证蕴涵真&quot;可证，则本身可证</li>\n<li>该规则在 GL 中可容许，但不属于 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"0218073c8db43619\" href=\"?note=0218073c8db43619\" title=\"89-df-gl-rule\">89-df-gl-rule</a> 列出的原始规则。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"89-df-gl-rule-lob","status":"resolved","id":"f661762c12e8f92b","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-df-gl-rule-lob]]","embed":false},{"target":"89-df-gl-rule-lob","status":"resolved","id":"f661762c12e8f92b","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathcal{R}_{L}\\subseteq\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}^{<\\omega}\\times\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}$ is the admissible Löb-rule relation (see [[89-df-gl-rule-lob]]).","embed":false},{"target":"89-df-gl-logic","status":"resolved","id":"0006800fa1c85177","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Remark]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{GL}$ : GL逻辑 (see [[89-df-gl-logic]])","embed":false},{"target":"89-df-lob-derivation","status":"resolved","id":"b22854791214adbd","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Remark]","excerpt":"Löb推导规则 (see [[89-df-lob-derivation]])","embed":false},{"target":"89-df-gl-rule","status":"resolved","id":"0218073c8db43619","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Remark]","excerpt":"该规则在 GL 中可容许，但不属于 [[89-df-gl-rule]] 列出的原始规则。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathcal{R}_{L}\\subseteq\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}^{<\\omega}\\times\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal R^{\\mathrm{der}}_L","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{der}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}lob\\text{-}derivation\\text{-}rule}\\vdash\n\\mathcal{R}^{\\mathrm{der}}_{L}\n\\coloneqq\n\\mathcal{R}_{L}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{GL}","display":false}],"bytes":1013,"backlinks":[{"id":"e0c421a5b45aeb77","anchor":"ref-339","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[89-df-lob-derivation-rule]]"}],"outgoing":["f661762c12e8f92b","0006800fa1c85177","b22854791214adbd","0218073c8db43619"]}